        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yona kūja Ninawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Yona lūkangala lo kabīlī; gūhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaga ū kū nzengo ntaale ū gwa Ninawi; kagūlomeelage ūmhayo ūyo nalīkwinha nene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yona ūzunya ūmo gūkahayīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, ūja ī Ninawi. Ū nzengo gwa Ninawi gwalī ntaale no, lwalī lūgendo lwa shikū idatū ū kūgūtīna a ha gatī gatī ūlīshimīza bo magūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū ū lwa kwandya ū Yona wingīla ū mu nzengo, wandya kūlomeela alīhaya, Jasaagaga shikū makūmi anè ī Ninawi īkenaagūlwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Ninawi būgūzunya ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu. Bikomiga kūfunga, nīyo pye a bose būzwala shizwalo sha magūnīla, kwandīja bataale kwika sīlīlī kūshisha kū bado bado.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mhola aho jampandīka ū ntemi wa Ninawi, akabūūka a h'isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi, ūzuula ī shizwalo shakwe sha nyatemi, wigumīīla myenda ya magūnīla hūna wigasha mu mabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akīīta ūlagīja mhayo gūhamukwe ū mu Ninawi gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizigela munhū wa kūloja shose shose, pyī nūūlū ī mitugo; ndūhū kūlya nūūlū kūng'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būlī munhū igumīīle magūnīla, nī mitugo jikumve magūnīla. Na būlī ng'wene anīlīīle Mulungu mu kwikūmbīlīja kūtaale; na īnge ū mu nzīla jakwe ī jabūbi, nū wiboneeji abūleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nani amanile? Nguno hamo ū Mulungu adūgije kūshosha moyo, kūlwa shigongo shakwe shitaale ūgalūka wīnga ū mu būpelanu bokwe tūleka ū kūyagaala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu aho wabona ūmo bakīītīla, nū mumo bakagalūkīla būjileka ī nzīla jabo jabūbi, akabachīla shigongo ūleka ū kūbenhela ū būkenaagūji ūbo walī wahela kūbenhela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
